			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751340301,
					"content": "呼，总算是结束了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340302,
					"content": "保护它的秘源机兵也安静下来了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340303,
					"content": "好吧，现在让我们看看这个里面到底是什么东西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340304,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340305,
					"content": "可不要让我失望哦…欸？又是一块火磷石，原来这东西还不止一枚的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340306,
					"content": "唔，等等，包裹它的织卷看起来也很眼熟啊…就像是我们最开始在遗迹外面的塔楼里捡到的那个笔记。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340307,
					"content": "呀…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340308,
					"content": "#哇，实在是太诡异了，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}你也这样觉得吧，{NICKNAME}你快看看上面写的什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340309,
					"content": "哇，居然真的是之前那个冒险家留下来的笔记，「统律之心」说的就是这里吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340310,
						751340312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340310,
					"content": "还有其它的可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340311,
					"content": "是哦，而且我们在这里也找到了新的火磷石，说不定在其它地方也会有很多呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340312,
					"content": "想不通的事情太多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340313,
					"content": "是哦，而且绿宝把我们指向了这里，难道是它早知道这下面还藏了一块火磷石，所以想要让我们拿到？真是搞不懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340314,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340315,
					"content": "我们还是先回去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340316,
					"content": "哎，确实，绿宝一定会知道些什么吧，而且也答应了玻娜不管发现了什么都要先回去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340317,
					"content": "带回去让玻娜看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340318,
					"content": "哎，确实，如果让玻娜看看的话说不定会有什么发现，而且也答应了她不管找到了什么都要先回去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340319,
					"content": "我们赶紧离开这里吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
